          <div class="htc-step-num"><div class="htc-num-circle"><div class="num-bg"></div><b>1</b></div><span class="htc-step-tag">~10 seconds</span></div>
          <h3 class="htc-step-title">Unscrew the Cap</h3>
          <p class="htc-step-desc">Hold the showerhead body with one hand and twist the bottom cap counterclockwise. It unscrews easily by hand — no tools needed.</p>
          <div class="htc-step-tip"><span class="htc-step-tip-icon">💡</span><p>If the cap feels tight from mineral buildup, run warm water over it for 10 seconds. It'll loosen right up.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="htc-step-content" data-step="1">
          <div class="htc-step-num"><div class="htc-num-circle"><div class="num-bg"></div><b>2</b></div><span class="htc-step-tag">~10 seconds</span></div>
          <h3 class="htc-step-title">Remove the Old Stones</h3>
          <p class="htc-step-desc">Tip the showerhead upside down over a trash can and let the used stones fall out. Give it a gentle shake to get the last few.</p>
          <div class="htc-step-tip"><span class="htc-step-tip-icon">👀</span><p>Notice the color change? Fresh stones are vibrant. Used stones look dull and grey — that means they've been doing their job.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="htc-step-content" data-step="2">
          <div class="htc-step-num"><div class="htc-num-circle"><div class="num-bg"></div><b>3</b></div><span class="htc-step-tag">~10 seconds</span></div>
          <h3 class="htc-step-title">Quick Rinse</h3>
          <p class="htc-step-desc">Hold the empty filter chamber under the faucet for a few seconds. This clears any sediment and gives your new stones a clean start.</p>
          <div class="htc-step-tip"><span class="htc-step-tip-icon">🚿</span><p>A quick rinse is all you need. No soap, no scrubbing — just plain water for 5 seconds.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="htc-step-content" data-step="3">
          <div class="htc-step-num"><div class="htc-num-circle"><div class="num-bg"></div><b>4</b></div><span class="htc-step-tag">~15 seconds</span></div>
          <h3 class="htc-step-title">Pour In Fresh Stones</h3>
          <p class="htc-step-desc">Open your new filter pouch and pour the mineral stones directly into the chamber. Each pouch contains the exact right amount — no measuring.</p>
          <div class="htc-step-tip"><span class="htc-step-tip-icon">✨</span><p>Fill to the line marked inside the chamber. Don't overfill or underfill for optimal water flow and filtration.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="htc-step-content" data-step="4">
          <div class="htc-step-num"><div class="htc-num-circle"><div class="num-bg"></div><b>5</b></div><span class="htc-step-tag">~10 seconds</span></div>
          <h3 class="htc-step-title">Screw It Back On — Done!</h3>
          <p class="htc-step-desc">Twist the cap clockwise until snug. Turn on the shower and enjoy fresh, filtered water immediately. That's it!</p>
          <div class="htc-step-tip"><span class="htc-step-tip-icon">🎉</span><p>Hand-tight is perfect. No tools needed. Run water for 15 seconds to activate the new stones before your first shower.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline -->
    <div class="htc-timeline">
      <div class="htc-tl-line"><div class="htc-tl-fill" id="htcFill"></div></div>
      <div class="htc-tl-step active" data-step="0" onclick="goToStep(0)"><div class="htc-tl-dot"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40"><circle class="htc-tl-track" cx="20" cy="20" r="18"/><circle class="htc-tl-progress" cx="20" cy="20" r="18"/></svg>1</div><div class="htc-tl-label">Unscrew Cap</div></div>
      <div class="htc-tl-step" data-step="1" onclick="goToStep(1)"><div class="htc-tl-dot"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40"><circle class="htc-tl-track" cx="20" cy="20" r="18"/><circle class="htc-tl-progress" cx="20" cy="20" r="18"/></svg>2</div><div class="htc-tl-label">Remove Old</div></div>
      <div class="htc-tl-step" data-step="2" onclick="goToStep(2)"><div class="htc-tl-dot"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40"><circle class="htc-tl-track" cx="20" cy="20" r="18"/><circle class="htc-tl-progress" cx="20" cy="20" r="18"/></svg>3</div><div class="htc-tl-label">Rinse</div></div>
      <div class="htc-tl-step" data-step="3" onclick="goToStep(3)"><div class="htc-tl-dot"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40"><circle class="htc-tl-track" cx="20" cy="20" r="18"/><circle class="htc-tl-progress" cx="20" cy="20" r="18"/></svg>4</div><div class="htc-tl-label">Pour New</div></div>
      <div class="htc-tl-step" data-step="4" onclick="goToStep(4)"><div class="htc-tl-dot"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40"><circle class="htc-tl-track" cx="20" cy="20" r="18"/><circle class="htc-tl-progress" cx="20" cy="20" r="18"/></svg>5</div><div class="htc-tl-label">Done!</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="htc-controls">
      <button class="htc-ctrl" onclick="prevStep()" title="Previous">◀</button>
      <button class="htc-ctrl playing" id="htcPlay" onclick="togglePlay()" title="Pause/Play">❚❚</button>
      <button class="htc-ctrl" onclick="nextStep()" title="Next">▶</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

